🧠 Lessons Learned

Splunk’s Interesting Fields and filtering helped quickly isolate the attacker.

Parsing form_data revealed credentials within POST requests.

Sorting by timestamp exposed the attack pattern (incremental password attempts).

🛡️ Recommendations

Enable account lockout & CAPTCHA for admin logins.

Add Splunk alert for excessive login attempts:

index="botsv1" http_method=POST uri="/administrator/index.php" | stats count by src_ip | where count > 50


Monitor application logs for successful logins after brute-force attempts.
